                        "description": {
                          "value": "You dance, Striding up to half your Speed. At either the start or end of your Stride, you create an area of magical darkness in a 10-foot burst centered on your location. This area is filled with magical darkness that works the same way as that created by a darkness spell of the same level. When you create the darkness, attempt a Performance check to dance, with a standard DC for your level, to determine the duration of the darkness.\n\nCritical Success: 1 minute\nSuccess: 2 rounds\nFailure: 1 round"
